      {
        "id": "source-curve-relationships",
        "description": "One solid U-shaped curve; it falls on the negative side and rises on the positive side. Its minimum is below the origin near the y axis, not on y=0. Left visible endpoint is about pixel (16,54), right about (374,49); there is no permission to extend either beyond the source stroke.\nCalibration recorded before interpolation: source origin approximately (196,293), x unit 30 pixels, y unit 30.3 pixels. Pixel readings are approximate, not exact given ordinates.\nQueried x=-3.6 is approximately pixel x=88,y=185 (y about 3.6); x=-2.1 is x=133,y=266 (y about 0.9); x=1.3 is x=235,y=291 (y about 0.1); x=2.8 is x=280,y=243 (y about 1.7). Ordinate reading uncertainty about 0.2 units; order is clear, no numeric answers are printed.\nNegative same-sign ordered arguments follow the falling source arm; positive same-sign ordered arguments follow the rising source arm. No formula, symmetry or exact zero/minimum ordinate is asserted from appearance.",
        "objects": [
          "source-left-end",
          "source-query-negative-lower",
          "source-query-negative-upper",
          "source-minimum-near-axis",
          "source-query-positive-lower",
          "source-query-positive-upper",
          "source-right-end",
          "source-traced-curve"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "source-left-end-to-query-negative-lower",
          "source-query-negative-lower-to-query-negative-upper",
          "source-query-negative-upper-to-minimum-near-axis",
          "source-minimum-near-axis-to-query-positive-lower",
          "source-query-positive-lower-to-query-positive-upper",
          "source-query-positive-upper-to-right-end"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "pointRelationships"
        ]
      }
    ]
